  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/mod-titles/more-chiselled-bookshelf-variants.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>Текстуры от <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcynthia.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cynthia</a> и pnku</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Chiseled-Bookshelf-Variants\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/requires-quad.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h2>Больше вариантов резных книжных полок</h2>\n<p>Наполните свои постройки красочным хранением книг: теперь у каждого типа дерева есть своя собственная резная книжная полка!</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/fjbi3.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"836\" height=\"299\"></p>\n<h3>Добавляет 11 новых вариантов резных книжных полок в Minecraft.</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
